1
00:00:00,012 --> 00:00:01,930
-[girl 1] See ya.
-[girl 2] See you tomorrow.

2
00:00:02,014 --> 00:00:03,890
[indistinct chatter]

3
00:00:03,974 --> 00:00:05,267
Hmm? Oh.

4
00:00:06,351 --> 00:00:07,769
[Anzu] There's Junta.

5
00:00:07,853 --> 00:00:09,688
He's working hard, as usual.

6
00:00:10,522 --> 00:00:12,858
Maybe I could watch him practice.

7
00:00:12,941 --> 00:00:14,776
Hey. No, wait a minute.

8
00:00:15,277 --> 00:00:16,737
-That's a bad idea.
-Hey!

9
00:00:16,820 --> 00:00:18,405
-[Anzu] I need to avoid anything…
-Mm… Ah!

10
00:00:18,488 --> 00:00:20,449
…that lets Riri plot something
at all costs.

11
00:00:20,532 --> 00:00:21,908
Are you okay?

12
00:00:21,992 --> 00:00:23,785
[Anzu] I could end up dead!

13
00:00:25,328 --> 00:00:26,788
Um… Hm!

14
00:00:32,002 --> 00:00:34,004
[theme music]

15
00:01:57,754 --> 00:02:01,049
#9 GINGER ALE IS A FORCE MAJEURE

16
00:02:01,758 --> 00:02:03,176
[Anzu] Now that I think about it,

17
00:02:03,260 --> 00:02:06,763
the baseball club manager's
actually really cute.

18
00:02:07,472 --> 00:02:10,600
I wonder if he'd ever date
someone like her.

19
00:02:10,684 --> 00:02:13,436
Maybe, if he weren't under Riri's spell.

20
00:02:13,979 --> 00:02:17,858
I feel terrible getting him involved
in this whole messed up situation.

21
00:02:18,525 --> 00:02:19,359
-Here.
-Ah…

22
00:02:19,442 --> 00:02:22,571
[announcer] Your attention, please.
Doors' opening on the right.

23
00:02:22,654 --> 00:02:24,781
-[doors open]
-[Riporin] Huh? Anzu?

24
00:02:24,865 --> 00:02:25,699
Huh?

25
00:02:27,242 --> 00:02:28,410
Yeah, it is.

26
00:02:28,952 --> 00:02:30,662
Amin, Riporin!

27
00:02:30,745 --> 00:02:32,873
Wow, how have you been, Anzu?

28
00:02:33,456 --> 00:02:36,001
We were just talking
about how we should have a reunion.

29
00:02:36,084 --> 00:02:37,627
Really? That'd be fun!

30
00:02:37,711 --> 00:02:39,754
We'll invite whoever we can contact.

31
00:02:39,838 --> 00:02:42,382
[Riporin] Hey, are you busy now?
Let's go have tea.

32
00:02:42,465 --> 00:02:44,217
That sounds great. Let's go!

33
00:02:44,301 --> 00:02:45,302
[Amin] Any ideas where?

34
00:02:45,385 --> 00:02:46,887
Let's do Zarigariya.

35
00:02:48,680 --> 00:02:51,766
[Anzu] Amin, I haven't seen you
since elementary school,

36
00:02:51,850 --> 00:02:54,352
but Riporin, we saw each other
at the station, remember?

37
00:02:54,436 --> 00:02:56,521
Yeah, that was ages ago.

38
00:02:56,605 --> 00:02:59,107
We couldn't even exchange contact info,

39
00:02:59,190 --> 00:03:01,318
because you didn't have a phone back then.

40
00:03:01,401 --> 00:03:03,403
Yeah, my parents waited to get me a phone,

41
00:03:03,486 --> 00:03:05,405
because I would just play games all day.

42
00:03:05,906 --> 00:03:07,824
No way. Well, it's true.

43
00:03:07,908 --> 00:03:10,952
You did spend all of your time
playing video games with the boys.

44
00:03:11,036 --> 00:03:13,830
That's true. And you guys played
some of the scary games.

45
00:03:14,414 --> 00:03:15,832
Oh, like Cat Ranger.

46
00:03:15,916 --> 00:03:19,169
[Anzu] Tonta and I were the only ones
who played it in the beginning.

47
00:03:19,669 --> 00:03:20,879
Tonta?

48
00:03:20,962 --> 00:03:22,589
Oh yeah, he was that, um,

49
00:03:22,672 --> 00:03:25,050
chubby kid with the, the wild hair.

50
00:03:25,133 --> 00:03:28,094
What? I don't remember.
What's his last name?

51
00:03:28,178 --> 00:03:30,013
What? His last name?

52
00:03:30,597 --> 00:03:34,100
Um, Tonta, um, Ton…

53
00:03:34,684 --> 00:03:36,895
You hung out so much,
how could you forget?

54
00:03:36,978 --> 00:03:38,188
[chuckles]

55
00:03:38,271 --> 00:03:41,149
Now let's see.
There was a "mi" in his last name.

56
00:03:41,691 --> 00:03:44,361
Hm, it's… Oh, that's right.

57
00:03:44,444 --> 00:03:45,820
It's Junta Hayami.

58
00:03:46,321 --> 00:03:47,364
What?

59
00:03:48,740 --> 00:03:51,952
[Anzu] What? What?

60
00:03:52,452 --> 00:03:55,372
How awesome, I got it. Hayami, was it?

61
00:03:55,455 --> 00:03:57,666
I wonder what he's up to these days.

62
00:03:57,749 --> 00:03:58,833
Hayami?

63
00:03:58,917 --> 00:04:01,378
Um, well,
I still can't remember that name.

64
00:04:02,504 --> 00:04:05,423
[Anzu] Hey, isn't that
a Cat Ranger character?

65
00:04:05,966 --> 00:04:07,592
Tonta, do you play too?

66
00:04:07,676 --> 00:04:08,969
Huh, mm-hm.

67
00:04:09,052 --> 00:04:11,888
For real? All right, let's play.

68
00:04:12,722 --> 00:04:14,266
I have been wanting to play in team mode

69
00:04:14,349 --> 00:04:17,018
and Ryuya and those guys don't play.
They're so boring.

70
00:04:17,602 --> 00:04:18,853
Come to my place!

71
00:04:18,937 --> 00:04:20,563
What? Really, Miss Hoshino?

72
00:04:20,647 --> 00:04:21,898
Call me Anzu.

73
00:04:22,649 --> 00:04:24,401
Okay, Miss Anzu.

74
00:04:24,484 --> 00:04:26,486
You can leave out the "Miss", okay?

75
00:04:28,655 --> 00:04:29,906
[Anzu] Tonta's…

76
00:04:30,740 --> 00:04:32,117
Junta?
[squealing]

77
00:04:32,200 --> 00:04:34,619
[Riporin] Anzu, you look like
you just ate a bee hive.

78
00:04:34,703 --> 00:04:36,288
[Amin] Do you have a stomachache?

79
00:04:36,871 --> 00:04:40,166
[Anzu] I can't believe how stupid I am.
I could just die.

80
00:04:40,250 --> 00:04:41,793
[both] Well, what happened?

81
00:04:41,876 --> 00:04:45,797
[Anzu] Uh, Tonta wasn't his real name.
It's a nickname.

82
00:04:45,880 --> 00:04:49,050
Jeez, when I think about it now,
it's totally obvious.

83
00:04:49,134 --> 00:04:53,013
I mean, what kind of jerk doesn't know
their friend's real name?

84
00:04:53,096 --> 00:04:55,265
He's not like some rando from online.

85
00:04:55,348 --> 00:04:56,474
[teacher] Next up, Hayami.

86
00:04:56,558 --> 00:04:57,559
Oh, yes.

87
00:04:57,642 --> 00:05:01,229
[Anzu] But to be fair,
Junta has changed dramatically.

88
00:05:01,313 --> 00:05:03,815
He's totally unrecognizable from before.

89
00:05:03,898 --> 00:05:05,066
[both] Anzu?

90
00:05:05,775 --> 00:05:10,155
[Anzu] Tonta, I mean Junta,
goes to the same school as me now.

91
00:05:10,238 --> 00:05:11,781
Oh, really, he does?

92
00:05:11,865 --> 00:05:14,534
Did you forget him
because he's kind of quiet?

93
00:05:15,118 --> 00:05:17,787
Well, he's had a dramatic transformation.

94
00:05:17,871 --> 00:05:20,457
Like an amoeba to an elephant.

95
00:05:20,540 --> 00:05:22,625
[Riporin]
That's like an entirely different species.

96
00:05:23,209 --> 00:05:25,253
Seriously? We have to see him.

97
00:05:25,337 --> 00:05:26,755
Yeah, I'm totally curious.

98
00:05:26,838 --> 00:05:28,423
-[Riporin] Call him!
-[Amin] Call him!

99
00:05:28,506 --> 00:05:31,051
Um… I guess I could give it a try,

100
00:05:31,134 --> 00:05:33,344
but he'll probably be tired from baseball.

101
00:05:39,017 --> 00:05:40,268
Hey, how's it going?

102
00:05:41,686 --> 00:05:42,771
[fork clangs]

103
00:05:42,854 --> 00:05:44,189
Who's this?

104
00:05:44,272 --> 00:05:46,316
You are a different species!

105
00:05:46,399 --> 00:05:49,277
Please be quiet. You're way too loud.

106
00:05:49,360 --> 00:05:51,404
Tonta's an athlete now?
[gasps]

107
00:05:51,488 --> 00:05:53,031
And he's hot!

108
00:05:53,114 --> 00:05:56,034
What happened
with all of your signature wild hair?

109
00:05:56,117 --> 00:05:58,286
It's still curly when it grows out.

110
00:05:58,870 --> 00:06:01,456
You're, um, Sayuki and, um, Igawa?

111
00:06:01,539 --> 00:06:02,791
-Riporin.
-Amin.

112
00:06:02,874 --> 00:06:03,958
[both] Be less formal!

113
00:06:04,459 --> 00:06:06,544
-I mean, we can be casual.
-Mm-hm.

114
00:06:06,628 --> 00:06:09,297
[Riporin] We're talking about
having a reunion next Saturday.

115
00:06:09,380 --> 00:06:10,465
[Amin] You'll come, right?

116
00:06:10,548 --> 00:06:12,258
Huh? A reunion?

117
00:06:12,926 --> 00:06:14,552
Anzu, are you gonna go?

118
00:06:15,136 --> 00:06:16,805
Well yeah, I was planning on it.

119
00:06:16,888 --> 00:06:19,265
I can't wait to see everyone's faces.

120
00:06:19,349 --> 00:06:21,768
We need everyone from school to see this

121
00:06:21,851 --> 00:06:24,312
and to understand
that Tonta the bashful, I mean,

122
00:06:24,395 --> 00:06:25,855
Junta, became an athlete.

123
00:06:26,856 --> 00:06:28,399
Sure, if Anzu is.

124
00:06:28,483 --> 00:06:31,778
Oh yeah, I have a game that day
so I might be late.

125
00:06:31,861 --> 00:06:32,904
No prob.

126
00:06:32,987 --> 00:06:34,114
I'm excited.

127
00:06:34,614 --> 00:06:37,158
Are you sure? You're so busy.

128
00:06:37,742 --> 00:06:38,993
Nah, I'll be all right.

129
00:06:39,577 --> 00:06:42,831
But, usually you practice more
once you get home.

130
00:06:42,914 --> 00:06:45,083
And then you walk me back from work too.

131
00:06:45,166 --> 00:06:47,752
So, how long have you guys been dating?

132
00:06:47,836 --> 00:06:48,878
-Huh?
-Huh?

133
00:06:48,962 --> 00:06:51,422
No! It's not like that!

134
00:06:51,506 --> 00:06:54,008
[Amin] It does make sense
that you're with him.

135
00:06:54,092 --> 00:06:56,427
[Riporin] Seriously, girl,
you've got a great eye.

136
00:06:56,511 --> 00:06:59,180
-[Anzu] Are we having fun?
-[Riporin] Oh, chill.

137
00:06:59,264 --> 00:07:01,266
[light music]

138
00:07:02,559 --> 00:07:07,772
[Anzu] This is unbelievable. Junta really
was my childhood friend, Tonta.

139
00:07:07,856 --> 00:07:08,898
So does that mean

140
00:07:08,982 --> 00:07:12,944
it's not just a spell,
and he actually does like me?

141
00:07:13,027 --> 00:07:17,532
[Riri] Junta's had a secret crush on you
since elementary school!

142
00:07:17,615 --> 00:07:18,908
Don't do this to him!

143
00:07:19,659 --> 00:07:21,161
[Anzu] Now that I know…

144
00:07:22,328 --> 00:07:24,038
-Hmm?
-Hmm.

145
00:07:24,747 --> 00:07:26,708
Uh, ugh!

146
00:07:28,209 --> 00:07:31,880
I want to crawl under a rock
of blissful ignorance.

147
00:07:31,963 --> 00:07:34,716
So, um, sounds like
you're a bit overwhelmed right now.

148
00:07:34,799 --> 00:07:35,800
What's going on?

149
00:07:39,721 --> 00:07:40,722
[sighs]

150
00:07:41,764 --> 00:07:43,433
[Riri] Ta-da!

151
00:07:44,017 --> 00:07:47,520
Yay! I am so excited for the reunion!

152
00:07:47,604 --> 00:07:50,607
And don't even think
about wearing your normal frumpy clothes.

153
00:07:50,690 --> 00:07:51,941
I'll pick out your outfit.

154
00:07:54,027 --> 00:07:56,905
[grunts]
What's going on here, Riri?

155
00:07:56,988 --> 00:07:58,948
[chuckles]
Whatever do you mean?

156
00:07:59,032 --> 00:07:59,949
[sighs]

157
00:08:00,575 --> 00:08:02,202
Junta was really Tonta.

158
00:08:02,285 --> 00:08:05,413
I thought he was an old friend
you made up using magic.

159
00:08:06,414 --> 00:08:07,957
-[Riri] You bonehead.
-Huh?

160
00:08:08,041 --> 00:08:11,461
I never ever ever told you
that I made him up now, did I?

161
00:08:12,420 --> 00:08:16,466
You just didn't recognize him at all
because he had transformed so much.

162
00:08:17,091 --> 00:08:21,262
Yeah, but didn't you cast a spell on Junta
so he would fall in love with me?

163
00:08:21,346 --> 00:08:23,973
[Riri] It's not a spell.
I had nothing to do with it.

164
00:08:24,057 --> 00:08:26,309
[Riri] Junta genuinely
has feelings for you,

165
00:08:26,392 --> 00:08:28,561
-and magic isn't even a factor.
-[Anzu] What?

166
00:08:29,062 --> 00:08:32,815
[Riri] Emotional manipulation
of our subjects is absolutely forbidden

167
00:08:32,899 --> 00:08:34,192
-among wizards.
-Huh?

168
00:08:34,275 --> 00:08:37,403
If that were allowed,
I would have cast a spell on you by now.

169
00:08:38,571 --> 00:08:39,531
That's true.

170
00:08:39,614 --> 00:08:43,493
I just shorten the amount of time
it would take for you to reunite.

171
00:08:43,576 --> 00:08:45,245
-What does that mean?
-[chuckles]

172
00:08:45,328 --> 00:08:48,414
[Riri] Well, for example,
at your high school orientation,

173
00:08:48,498 --> 00:08:51,084
Junta saw you
and he even tried to talk to you.

174
00:08:51,167 --> 00:08:52,377
[Anzu] What, he did?

175
00:08:52,460 --> 00:08:54,420
-[Miyoko] Anzu, I'm here. Let's go.
-Huh?

176
00:08:55,588 --> 00:08:58,049
[Riri] However, Miss Gamer,
what do you think you did?

177
00:08:58,132 --> 00:09:01,010
[Anzu] Huh, uh, I don't remember what I…

178
00:09:01,094 --> 00:09:03,805
Why don't we have lunch together
before we head home?

179
00:09:03,888 --> 00:09:07,600
Ah! I needed to use a recovery spell
to win the game!

180
00:09:07,684 --> 00:09:09,769
-Uh, hurry, let's go home.
-What?

181
00:09:09,852 --> 00:09:12,814
[Miyoko] Hey Anzu, what about lunch?
Aren't you hungry?

182
00:09:12,897 --> 00:09:14,566
[Anzu] Finishing the game is priority one.

183
00:09:14,649 --> 00:09:17,110
-[Miyoko] Oh good grief, Anzu!
-[Junta sighs]

184
00:09:18,152 --> 00:09:19,279
[chuckles]

185
00:09:19,362 --> 00:09:20,572
Oh yeah.

186
00:09:20,655 --> 00:09:23,825
I was just about to finish a game,
so I ran home to play it.

187
00:09:23,908 --> 00:09:24,909
That's right.

188
00:09:24,993 --> 00:09:29,122
Splendidly, flawlessly, foolishly,
you completely ignored him.

189
00:09:29,706 --> 00:09:31,583
And once you started school…

190
00:09:32,166 --> 00:09:34,961
you would always rush straight home
as soon as classes ended,

191
00:09:35,044 --> 00:09:36,588
-so you could play your games!
-[gasps]

192
00:09:36,671 --> 00:09:37,880
-[metal clanging]
-[grunts]

193
00:09:37,964 --> 00:09:39,799
[Riri] It was like you were trying
to set a record

194
00:09:39,882 --> 00:09:41,593
for who could get home the fastest.

195
00:09:41,676 --> 00:09:42,594
Uh…

196
00:09:42,677 --> 00:09:44,095
[Riri] And in Junta's case,

197
00:09:44,178 --> 00:09:45,972
he keeps missing the chance
to talk to you,

198
00:09:46,055 --> 00:09:48,182
because baseball has him so busy.

199
00:09:49,434 --> 00:09:50,560
Huh?

200
00:09:51,894 --> 00:09:53,146
[coach] First-years, gather!

201
00:09:56,691 --> 00:10:00,653
[Riri] So I cut off the reunion,
because you two were taking too damn long!

202
00:10:00,737 --> 00:10:02,113
[Anzu] You can't just cut it!

203
00:10:03,698 --> 00:10:06,451
[Riri] All of it is to help you
find love, Anzu.

204
00:10:06,534 --> 00:10:08,244
Ugh, it's none of your business!

205
00:10:08,328 --> 00:10:09,829
-[bones crack]
-I don't care anymore!

206
00:10:09,912 --> 00:10:12,457
Just give me back
my three greatest desires!

207
00:10:12,540 --> 00:10:13,374
[Riri] That hurts!

208
00:10:13,458 --> 00:10:15,084
[in strained voice]
If I do nothing,

209
00:10:15,168 --> 00:10:19,714
then your dictionary will have
no entry included for romance.

210
00:10:19,797 --> 00:10:20,882
[grunts]
I surrender, I surrender.

211
00:10:20,965 --> 00:10:22,383
VIDEO GAMES: VERY FUN. CHOCOLATE:
DELICIOUS. CAT: FLUFFY AND CUTE.

212
00:10:23,092 --> 00:10:26,304
Ugh, could any romance replace
the three things I love most?

213
00:10:26,387 --> 00:10:29,057
But you're the Anti-Heroine,
how could you say that?

214
00:10:29,140 --> 00:10:30,058
Ugh…

215
00:10:30,141 --> 00:10:33,186
[Riri] With girls like you,
we have to be a bit more aggressive,

216
00:10:33,770 --> 00:10:36,314
or you'll keep missing
great opportunities.

217
00:10:36,898 --> 00:10:38,316
[laughing mischievously]

218
00:10:39,025 --> 00:10:41,569
-[Riri] And die alone!
-[Anzu] Jeez, harsh much?

219
00:10:41,653 --> 00:10:44,947
Hold on, why am I the only one
being treated like an outcast?

220
00:10:45,740 --> 00:10:48,076
Saki has no interest in dating either.

221
00:10:48,576 --> 00:10:52,163
[Riri] That's because Saki is
already insanely popular.

222
00:10:52,246 --> 00:10:53,122
[gasps]

223
00:10:53,206 --> 00:10:55,249
[fan] Saki, please, I love you so much!

224
00:10:55,333 --> 00:10:57,126
[Riri] So she won't need help
finding someone.

225
00:10:57,210 --> 00:10:58,252
SAKI LOVE

226
00:10:59,504 --> 00:11:03,007
I'm so sorry, for even considering
I'm in the same league as her.

227
00:11:03,091 --> 00:11:05,385
Now, do you understand it, huh?

228
00:11:05,468 --> 00:11:07,011
What we're doing, Anzu,

229
00:11:07,095 --> 00:11:10,223
is a romantic relationship project
to help you find a love

230
00:11:10,306 --> 00:11:12,767
that surpasses your love
for your greatest desires.

231
00:11:12,850 --> 00:11:14,143
[grumbles]

232
00:11:14,227 --> 00:11:16,437
Well, I say screw that project.

233
00:11:17,647 --> 00:11:20,525
But anyway, even if Tonta is Junta,

234
00:11:20,608 --> 00:11:22,985
the fact remains
that the two of us are just friends.

235
00:11:24,195 --> 00:11:25,071
Heh?

236
00:11:26,114 --> 00:11:27,365
[Riri] Huh?

237
00:11:27,448 --> 00:11:29,117
[Riri] Um, hmm?

238
00:11:29,617 --> 00:11:31,744
[Anzu] Get out!

239
00:11:31,828 --> 00:11:33,871
[Riri] You kick me out now?

240
00:11:38,918 --> 00:11:41,587
Hey, what happened to Tonta?

241
00:11:41,671 --> 00:11:44,048
-[Ryuya] He left already.
-Really?

242
00:11:44,132 --> 00:11:46,843
Oh, I wanted to game with him today.

243
00:11:46,926 --> 00:11:49,595
He told me that he's sick
of playing Cat Ranger.

244
00:11:49,679 --> 00:11:50,596
Seriously?

245
00:11:50,680 --> 00:11:53,641
We were just talking about
how we wanted to beat the top score.

246
00:11:53,724 --> 00:11:55,435
You should beat it with us then!

247
00:11:55,518 --> 00:11:57,145
-Yeah!
-[chuckles awkwardly]

248
00:11:57,228 --> 00:11:59,647
You guys didn't even want
to play Cat Ranger before.

249
00:11:59,730 --> 00:12:01,858
-[Katsun] Hey, that's not true.
-[Ryuya sighs, groans]

250
00:12:02,733 --> 00:12:05,153
[indistinct chatter]

251
00:12:05,778 --> 00:12:08,114
Did you say Anzu was coming
to the reunion too?

252
00:12:08,197 --> 00:12:10,700
Anzu? Yeah, she's coming.

253
00:12:10,783 --> 00:12:13,035
Was graduation the last time you saw her?

254
00:12:13,119 --> 00:12:14,036
Yeah.

255
00:12:14,120 --> 00:12:17,039
Heh, she'll probably come
in her lame cat clothes.

256
00:12:17,123 --> 00:12:19,542
-[Anzu] You've got a problem with cats?
-[girls] Huh?

257
00:12:19,625 --> 00:12:21,294
-[Ryuya] Anzu?
-Wow.

258
00:12:21,377 --> 00:12:24,922
Look at you, Anzu,
you look so cute, all dressed up.

259
00:12:25,006 --> 00:12:27,091
That's right, girlie. Rock on.

260
00:12:27,175 --> 00:12:28,259
Uh…

261
00:12:28,342 --> 00:12:31,179
Wow, Anzu's got decent clothes on, guys.

262
00:12:31,262 --> 00:12:32,805
And your hair's not everywhere.

263
00:12:32,889 --> 00:12:35,099
I'm really sorry
to disappoint you all, fellas.

264
00:12:35,683 --> 00:12:37,143
[Anzu] But it's only thanks to their help.

265
00:12:37,226 --> 00:12:39,937
I gotta pee! I really gotta pee!

266
00:12:40,021 --> 00:12:41,939
Please just stay still now.

267
00:12:42,023 --> 00:12:44,650
Hey, you forgot to take off the tag.

268
00:12:44,734 --> 00:12:46,611
Just because you changed a little,

269
00:12:46,694 --> 00:12:49,197
doesn't mean you can act
like you're all that.

270
00:12:49,280 --> 00:12:51,824
Clearly, you haven't changed much, Ryuya,

271
00:12:51,908 --> 00:12:52,992
especially your height.

272
00:12:53,075 --> 00:12:55,203
-Hey, I'm still growing, all right?
-[chuckles]

273
00:12:55,286 --> 00:12:57,622
I mean, maybe you just grew too much!

274
00:12:58,956 --> 00:13:01,209
Hey, let's play girls against guys.

275
00:13:01,709 --> 00:13:04,128
The team
with the highest total score wins.

276
00:13:04,629 --> 00:13:07,507
There's more girls than guys,
so that sounds fair, right?

277
00:13:08,132 --> 00:13:10,092
Yeah, I'm in. Sounds like fun.

278
00:13:10,176 --> 00:13:12,094
So, what should the losers have to do?

279
00:13:12,178 --> 00:13:13,804
[girls] What?

280
00:13:13,888 --> 00:13:16,891
How about, losers confess
who their first love was?

281
00:13:17,725 --> 00:13:20,603
Uh-oh, I can only think
of game characters.

282
00:13:20,686 --> 00:13:22,897
[Katsun] We don't expect too much
from you, Bushy.

283
00:13:23,481 --> 00:13:25,358
Well, what should we do?

284
00:13:25,441 --> 00:13:26,484
[worried sigh]

285
00:13:26,984 --> 00:13:28,736
[Anzu] I'm on the girls' team,

286
00:13:28,819 --> 00:13:30,947
so everything is gonna be a-okay.

287
00:13:31,030 --> 00:13:31,864
MASTER OF GAMES

288
00:13:31,948 --> 00:13:32,907
-[chuckling]
-Yeah!

289
00:13:32,990 --> 00:13:36,786
[Anzu] Huh, do you have any idea
what it means to challenge me?

290
00:13:36,869 --> 00:13:40,957
You're all merely average fools!
You have hardly won any games!

291
00:13:41,040 --> 00:13:43,543
I'll make sure
that you all know your place!

292
00:13:43,626 --> 00:13:45,670
-Anzu!
-Yay, Anzu!

293
00:13:45,753 --> 00:13:48,130
You sound just like a villain, girl.

294
00:13:48,839 --> 00:13:51,634
Don't think that this game's
going down like that!

295
00:13:51,717 --> 00:13:53,970
This isn't grade school, you'll be silly!

296
00:13:54,053 --> 00:13:55,137
You mean, "sorry."

297
00:13:55,221 --> 00:13:57,223
[both growl]

298
00:13:57,306 --> 00:13:59,725
[girls cheering]

299
00:13:59,809 --> 00:14:01,727
[Anzu] Nobody realizes

300
00:14:01,811 --> 00:14:03,604
that the secret to winning in bowling…

301
00:14:04,522 --> 00:14:07,567
is that you first have to read
the oil on the lane…

302
00:14:09,819 --> 00:14:11,904
then visualize your target.

303
00:14:13,030 --> 00:14:16,033
And finally, you inject that motivation!

304
00:14:16,117 --> 00:14:19,370
Now, prepare for death!

305
00:14:20,788 --> 00:14:23,332
-[squealing]
-[girls] Strike!

306
00:14:23,416 --> 00:14:25,751
[screaming]

307
00:14:29,130 --> 00:14:32,425
[Anzu] I just got to smash Riri
so many times!

308
00:14:32,508 --> 00:14:34,051
GIRLS' TEAM WIN!

309
00:14:34,135 --> 00:14:37,471
[Anzu] Now, as promised,
tell us who all your first loves were.

310
00:14:37,555 --> 00:14:39,557
FIGHT ON

311
00:14:39,640 --> 00:14:41,142
And get down on your knees!

312
00:14:41,225 --> 00:14:42,810
[Katsun] Don't make it worse.

313
00:14:43,477 --> 00:14:44,645
[Sota] Well, what can we do?

314
00:14:44,729 --> 00:14:47,398
-[Sota] Let's sit down, at least.
-[Katsun] Uh, you go first, man.

315
00:14:48,399 --> 00:14:51,360
Um! Mine was… It was Okawa.

316
00:14:51,444 --> 00:14:52,612
[girls] Ooh!

317
00:14:53,154 --> 00:14:54,822
Mine was Yoshida.

318
00:14:54,906 --> 00:14:56,449
[girls laughing]

319
00:14:56,532 --> 00:14:58,701
Mine was Amin.

320
00:15:00,202 --> 00:15:03,456
Huh, who? Me? No way.

321
00:15:03,539 --> 00:15:05,166
It's over!

322
00:15:05,249 --> 00:15:07,460
-[wails]
-Hey, Ryuya, you're next.

323
00:15:07,543 --> 00:15:08,961
[gasps]

324
00:15:09,045 --> 00:15:10,963
Fine. Mine was…

325
00:15:11,047 --> 00:15:13,966
[boy] Yamaguchi, you cool dude,
get a hold of yourself!

326
00:15:14,050 --> 00:15:16,552
[Anzu] Good thing
Junta didn't get here yet.

327
00:15:16,636 --> 00:15:18,971
-I always liked Anzu!
-[chuckles]

328
00:15:19,805 --> 00:15:21,557
-[screams]
-[Sota] Come on, man.

329
00:15:22,058 --> 00:15:23,059
Hey.

330
00:15:23,768 --> 00:15:25,186
My preschool teacher.

331
00:15:25,937 --> 00:15:27,980
[both] You've got to give us
something better than that, dude!

332
00:15:28,064 --> 00:15:29,523
[scoffs]
Damn it!

333
00:15:29,607 --> 00:15:31,525
We won't lose again! Rematch, now!

334
00:15:31,609 --> 00:15:33,194
Again, dude? Really?

335
00:15:33,277 --> 00:15:35,446
Yamaguchi's HP is at zero.

336
00:15:36,447 --> 00:15:37,865
[Ryuya] This is revenge!

337
00:15:37,949 --> 00:15:40,618
Come on, guys!
Let's show these girls what we've got!

338
00:15:40,701 --> 00:15:43,162
Sure, guys. I mean,
if you want to look even worse.

339
00:15:43,245 --> 00:15:44,246
[giggling]

340
00:15:44,330 --> 00:15:46,248
[all groan]

341
00:15:46,832 --> 00:15:49,043
Okay then, losers buy ice cream.

342
00:15:49,126 --> 00:15:51,879
Your crushes were less interesting
than I could have imagined.

343
00:15:51,963 --> 00:15:53,297
[groans]

344
00:15:53,381 --> 00:15:56,008
Now you just put his HP in the negative!

345
00:15:56,634 --> 00:15:57,635
[Anzu chuckles]

346
00:15:57,718 --> 00:16:00,054
-[Anzu] Saw this coming?
-[Ryuya groans]

347
00:16:02,640 --> 00:16:05,893
-Yay! Now let's all do karaoke!
-[annoyed grunt]

348
00:16:07,520 --> 00:16:10,106
Anzu, I challenge you to karaoke!

349
00:16:10,189 --> 00:16:11,148
Sure thing.

350
00:16:11,732 --> 00:16:13,275
Ryuya, just let it go, man.

351
00:16:13,359 --> 00:16:14,819
Hey, you know what,

352
00:16:14,902 --> 00:16:17,863
you guys really haven't changed
since grade school.

353
00:16:17,947 --> 00:16:21,367
[Ryuya] ♪ Girl, you know I'm sorry
To be forceful ♪

354
00:16:21,450 --> 00:16:24,787
♪ I promise you a future
Will be wonderful ♪

355
00:16:25,621 --> 00:16:26,497
YOU HAVE A FIRM VOICE.

356
00:16:26,580 --> 00:16:27,873
PRACTICE ADJUSTING THE PITCH
AND AIM FOR A HIGHER SCORE.

357
00:16:27,957 --> 00:16:29,750
All right. Not bad.

358
00:16:29,834 --> 00:16:35,965
♪ And I will decide myself ♪

359
00:16:37,091 --> 00:16:37,925
PITCH AT THE BEGINNING IS PERFECT

360
00:16:38,009 --> 00:16:38,926
IT WOULD BE GOOD
IF YOU TRY TO RELAX MORE

361
00:16:39,635 --> 00:16:42,930
-[Ryuya] No! I don't believe this!
-[girls cheering, laughing]

362
00:16:43,014 --> 00:16:46,600
♪ Oh yeah, I'll never let you go ♪

363
00:16:46,684 --> 00:16:48,102
♪ No, no, no ♪

364
00:16:48,185 --> 00:16:49,687
♪ Please don't try to break my heart ♪

365
00:16:49,770 --> 00:16:51,480
[cheering]

366
00:16:52,398 --> 00:16:54,233
-You're such a sore loser.
-Hmph!

367
00:16:54,316 --> 00:16:55,776
-[slurping]
-[giggles]

368
00:16:55,860 --> 00:16:58,320
Oh come on,
you losing to me is such old news.

369
00:16:58,404 --> 00:17:00,990
[Ryuya] Anzu, you really know
how to piss me off!

370
00:17:01,073 --> 00:17:04,493
Oh, you're one to talk, Ryuya.
You're just a two-timer.

371
00:17:04,577 --> 00:17:07,038
What? You're a two-timer? Really?

372
00:17:07,121 --> 00:17:08,748
[splutters]
Hey, shut up!

373
00:17:08,831 --> 00:17:10,499
[both] Yeah, but it's true.

374
00:17:10,583 --> 00:17:12,001
-[grumbles]
-[Riporin] Oh, come on.

375
00:17:12,084 --> 00:17:15,087
Quit your moping.
Just sing a song with Anzu and cheer up.

376
00:17:15,171 --> 00:17:16,964
Oh, all right, fine.

377
00:17:19,383 --> 00:17:20,843
So, what do you wanna sing?

378
00:17:21,719 --> 00:17:22,595
YOU HAVE A NEW MESSAGE

379
00:17:22,678 --> 00:17:24,972
-[Anzu] Oh, um.
-[phone meows]

380
00:17:26,057 --> 00:17:27,975
Oh, Junta just got here.

381
00:17:28,059 --> 00:17:30,311
-[Anzu] I'll go get him.
-[door opens]

382
00:17:30,895 --> 00:17:33,105
-Remind me who is Junta again?
-[door closes]

383
00:17:33,189 --> 00:17:34,273
Junta is Tonta.

384
00:17:34,774 --> 00:17:37,234
Oh yeah, I vaguely remember him.

385
00:17:37,318 --> 00:17:40,780
Wait, didn't he, like,
move away or something?

386
00:17:40,863 --> 00:17:42,281
Yeah, but then he moved back.

387
00:17:42,364 --> 00:17:45,076
And now he goes to school where Anzu goes.

388
00:17:45,159 --> 00:17:46,577
He had a ball game today.

389
00:17:46,660 --> 00:17:47,995
Ball game?

390
00:17:48,079 --> 00:17:51,165
I don't really remember him
being the athletic type.

391
00:17:51,248 --> 00:17:53,375
[mischievous laughter]

392
00:17:53,459 --> 00:17:55,544
-[both] Oh?
-We're back.

393
00:17:56,837 --> 00:17:59,048
Oh, um. Hey there, everyone.

394
00:17:59,548 --> 00:18:01,467
-[girl] Wow.
-[exclaiming]

395
00:18:02,301 --> 00:18:03,427
[both] Ta-da!

396
00:18:03,511 --> 00:18:06,305
-Here's Tonta!
-Or Junta Hayami!

397
00:18:07,389 --> 00:18:09,016
[all] Huh?

398
00:18:09,100 --> 00:18:10,059
HE'S GROWN!

399
00:18:10,142 --> 00:18:12,019
[friends] He's Tonta?

400
00:18:12,561 --> 00:18:14,271
[Yamaguchi] You got way too tall, man!

401
00:18:14,355 --> 00:18:16,482
[girl] I don't recall
you being such a cutie, though.

402
00:18:16,565 --> 00:18:20,945
Wait, are you the Junta Hayami?
Of Shunkan's baseball team?

403
00:18:21,028 --> 00:18:22,404
[Junta] Oh, yeah.

404
00:18:22,488 --> 00:18:24,365
Really? That's so awesome!

405
00:18:24,949 --> 00:18:26,992
Didn't you have an RBI last game?

406
00:18:27,076 --> 00:18:29,537
I, I'm a total
high school baseball nut, dude.

407
00:18:29,620 --> 00:18:33,082
This is amazing. I can't believe
Tonta's a star athlete now.

408
00:18:33,165 --> 00:18:34,625
[Sota] Jeez, can I get your autograph?

409
00:18:35,584 --> 00:18:37,670
-I totally didn't recognize you at all.
-[chuckles]

410
00:18:37,753 --> 00:18:39,463
And you're so tall now.

411
00:18:39,547 --> 00:18:41,048
How tall are you, anyway?

412
00:18:41,132 --> 00:18:43,926
[chuckles nervously]
I don't know, maybe, six one?

413
00:18:44,009 --> 00:18:46,178
You must be popular.
Do you have a girlfriend?

414
00:18:46,262 --> 00:18:48,180
His girlfriend's right over here.

415
00:18:48,264 --> 00:18:50,724
-[liquid splashes]
-I am not!

416
00:18:50,808 --> 00:18:52,268
Oh! The ginger ale stings!

417
00:18:52,351 --> 00:18:55,437
-That's so gross, bro.
-It's not like that.

418
00:18:55,521 --> 00:18:58,107
Well, you and Anzu do make sense.

419
00:18:58,190 --> 00:18:59,942
Yeah, you guys have been friends forever.

420
00:19:00,442 --> 00:19:03,612
[chuckles mockingly]
You guys seriously crack me up.

421
00:19:03,696 --> 00:19:06,740
-Huh?
-Now you wanna be friends with him?

422
00:19:07,449 --> 00:19:10,953
Tonta, you must think
you're so much better than us now.

423
00:19:11,036 --> 00:19:12,746
Oh come on, Ryuya, please don't do this.

424
00:19:13,330 --> 00:19:16,208
I mean, you're tall,
and yeah, you're athletic.

425
00:19:17,084 --> 00:19:19,086
And on top of that, you're tall too.

426
00:19:19,170 --> 00:19:20,671
You said "tall" twice, dude.

427
00:19:21,547 --> 00:19:24,466
You just came to show off
how hot you are now, right?

428
00:19:25,050 --> 00:19:26,177
-[Anzu] So tell me…
-[friends gasp]

429
00:19:27,052 --> 00:19:30,264
Is it so bad that a person
should feel better after improving?

430
00:19:30,347 --> 00:19:31,265
Uh…

431
00:19:31,348 --> 00:19:35,060
[Anzu] Plus, Junta isn't doing
any of it for attention.

432
00:19:35,644 --> 00:19:39,064
He's dedicated and works hard.
He practices 24/7.

433
00:19:40,399 --> 00:19:42,401
So it's not fair to dismiss Junta

434
00:19:42,484 --> 00:19:44,862
and treat him
like he's just another pretty face.

435
00:19:45,779 --> 00:19:47,948
[grumbles]
I'm out.

436
00:19:48,032 --> 00:19:50,409
-What? Huh? Ryuya!
-[door opens]

437
00:19:50,993 --> 00:19:52,244
[door closes]

438
00:19:53,579 --> 00:19:55,831
Sorry guys, I'll be right back.

439
00:19:56,415 --> 00:19:58,250
-[door closes]
-[sighs]

440
00:19:58,334 --> 00:20:00,085
Hold up, Ryuya!

441
00:20:01,378 --> 00:20:03,464
I'm sorry I made a scene, okay?

442
00:20:03,547 --> 00:20:05,341
But I'm leaving, so it's fine now, right?

443
00:20:05,424 --> 00:20:08,469
Ryuya, jeez! Will you knock it off
with the moping!

444
00:20:08,552 --> 00:20:09,970
[grunts]
Hey!

445
00:20:10,971 --> 00:20:12,306
Just so you know.

446
00:20:12,389 --> 00:20:16,143
Not once did I ever feel bored
hanging out with you, Ryuya.

447
00:20:16,227 --> 00:20:17,102
[gasps]

448
00:20:17,186 --> 00:20:19,230
[Anzu] So there's no reason to be jealous.

449
00:20:19,813 --> 00:20:22,942
Just shut up.
And don't try to make me stay.

450
00:20:23,943 --> 00:20:28,072
-Anyway, you must be sick of me, right?
-[Anzu chuckles]

451
00:20:28,155 --> 00:20:31,992
Your wicked, cantankerous attitude
makes you kind of interesting.

452
00:20:32,076 --> 00:20:34,787
You were super devious
when we play games too.

453
00:20:34,870 --> 00:20:38,040
Are those supposed to be compliments?
Jeez, Anzu.

454
00:20:38,916 --> 00:20:42,086
Listen, I know I made it awkward
for you to stay

455
00:20:42,169 --> 00:20:43,545
because of how I spoke up.

456
00:20:44,046 --> 00:20:46,507
But those guys will understand.

457
00:20:47,716 --> 00:20:50,052
And don't worry,
this doesn't make me hate you.

458
00:20:50,135 --> 00:20:51,428
We can still be friends.

459
00:20:51,512 --> 00:20:52,346
[sighs]

460
00:20:52,930 --> 00:20:53,806
[soft chuckle]

461
00:20:54,848 --> 00:20:56,267
[exhales deeply]

462
00:20:56,350 --> 00:20:59,979
Oh man, this is crazy.
You really haven't changed at all.

463
00:21:00,062 --> 00:21:03,732
What? I mean, I'm a little more womanly
at this point, right?

464
00:21:03,816 --> 00:21:05,567
[Ryuya] That's not what I meant.

465
00:21:05,651 --> 00:21:09,321
I didn't think I had feelings anymore
because it's been years.

466
00:21:10,656 --> 00:21:13,742
But I, um, I lied before.

467
00:21:14,493 --> 00:21:16,078
My preschool teacher.

468
00:21:17,204 --> 00:21:20,582
[Ryuya]
My real first love was, it was you.

469
00:21:21,166 --> 00:21:22,376
[all gasp]

470
00:21:22,459 --> 00:21:23,961
I mean, um…

471
00:21:25,337 --> 00:21:27,506
-I still really like--
-Sorry, no way.

472
00:21:27,589 --> 00:21:30,301
[shocked groan]
Hey, at least let me finish!

473
00:21:30,384 --> 00:21:32,052
Sorry, I couldn't hold it in.

474
00:21:32,136 --> 00:21:36,056
Anyway, I'd never be with someone
who'd date two girls at once!

475
00:21:36,140 --> 00:21:39,435
You have a girlfriend, and now
you're telling me that you like me too?

476
00:21:39,518 --> 00:21:41,854
Uh… Uh, but well, we--

477
00:21:42,438 --> 00:21:44,148
we went to different schools, Anzu!

478
00:21:44,857 --> 00:21:45,983
What was I supposed to do?

479
00:21:46,066 --> 00:21:48,277
She was really sweet and she lives close.

480
00:21:48,861 --> 00:21:50,779
[sighs]
Seriously, dude?

481
00:21:50,863 --> 00:21:54,283
But I… I thought about you
the whole time I was with her.

482
00:21:54,366 --> 00:21:57,870
And another girl asked me out
and I thought she'd help me forget you.

483
00:21:58,370 --> 00:22:01,457
Anyway, I messed up.
And I looked like a cheater.

484
00:22:01,540 --> 00:22:03,083
You're a trash bag.

485
00:22:03,167 --> 00:22:06,170
Gah! Thank you for being real.

486
00:22:06,253 --> 00:22:09,715
Gah, but how come
I still like you after all this?

487
00:22:09,798 --> 00:22:12,384
[sighs]
You're cold, you're not sexy.

488
00:22:12,468 --> 00:22:14,303
You shoot ginger ale out of your nose.

489
00:22:14,386 --> 00:22:16,388
The ginger ale was a total act of God.

490
00:22:17,014 --> 00:22:17,931
[Ryuya] Hey.

491
00:22:18,599 --> 00:22:20,893
Do I really not stand a chance?

492
00:22:21,477 --> 00:22:22,603
[Anzu gasps]

493
00:22:24,271 --> 00:22:25,856
I appreciate how you feel.

494
00:22:26,356 --> 00:22:27,524
I really do.

495
00:22:27,608 --> 00:22:29,943
But I wanna be with someone
who wouldn't cheat on me

496
00:22:30,027 --> 00:22:31,487
just because we're apart.

497
00:22:32,821 --> 00:22:35,824
-Do you mean, someone like Tonta?
-[chokes, gasps]

498
00:22:35,908 --> 00:22:38,077
[Anzu] Huh? He totally nailed it!

499
00:22:38,160 --> 00:22:41,663
No, not at all. I don't think
Junta sees me like that anyway.

500
00:22:41,747 --> 00:22:43,832
What? Are you really that dumb?

501
00:22:43,916 --> 00:22:46,585
[Ryuya] That's been totally obvious
for eons, Anzu!

502
00:22:48,212 --> 00:22:51,548
Anyway, you and I are friends
and nothing more, Ryuya!

503
00:22:51,632 --> 00:22:54,760
You're too straightforward!
My heart's torn to shreds!

504
00:22:54,843 --> 00:22:56,261
-[girls giggling in distance]
-[both] Huh?

505
00:22:56,345 --> 00:22:58,222
Ryuya just got rejected!

506
00:22:58,305 --> 00:23:00,390
Oh jeez, I couldn't hold it in anymore!

507
00:23:00,474 --> 00:23:03,769
Hey, that's messed up!
Don't laugh about my unrequited love!

508
00:23:04,561 --> 00:23:06,021
Now, I'm ruined.

509
00:23:06,105 --> 00:23:09,149
They already make fun of me
because they know I like you.

510
00:23:09,233 --> 00:23:11,235
[Anzu] It's not like
your first love was a disgrace.

511
00:23:12,152 --> 00:23:14,279
You guys came over
because you were worried, right?

512
00:23:14,363 --> 00:23:15,697
Yeah.

513
00:23:16,532 --> 00:23:19,910
I was worried
because I thought I made you feel bad.

514
00:23:20,452 --> 00:23:22,621
How could you possibly care about me?

515
00:23:22,704 --> 00:23:24,540
Now I feel really petty.

516
00:23:24,623 --> 00:23:26,917
-Well, you should. You are.
-Just shut up!

517
00:23:27,501 --> 00:23:28,585
I'm sorry.

518
00:23:28,669 --> 00:23:30,879
I just got jealous
but don't worry about it.

519
00:23:32,506 --> 00:23:33,841
Anzu got it right.

520
00:23:33,924 --> 00:23:35,884
You did a lot to improve yourself.

521
00:23:36,718 --> 00:23:38,137
That's hella impressive.

522
00:23:38,887 --> 00:23:40,430
[soft chuckle]
Thanks, Ryuya.

523
00:23:40,973 --> 00:23:43,142
[Ryuya] Hey, you don't have
to thank me, dude.

524
00:23:43,225 --> 00:23:44,893
[girls giggling]

525
00:23:44,977 --> 00:23:47,896
[Anzu] All right, let's go back.
Everyone's waiting.

526
00:23:47,980 --> 00:23:51,024
[Riporin] Both Ryuya and Junta?
You're so popular, Anzu.

527
00:23:51,108 --> 00:23:52,860
[Anzu] Junta doesn't feel that way
about me.

528
00:23:53,694 --> 00:23:58,157
[Anzu] I just gotta lean into
the heroine oblivious twist feelings act.

529
00:23:59,449 --> 00:24:00,534
Tonta, wait up.

530
00:24:01,535 --> 00:24:05,247
I actually lied about something
a long time ago.

531
00:24:05,914 --> 00:24:07,124
Hmm?

532
00:24:07,207 --> 00:24:08,417
Hey, Tonta.

533
00:24:08,917 --> 00:24:11,962
Anzu said she doesn't wanna play
Cat Ranger with you anymore,

534
00:24:12,462 --> 00:24:14,590
because she's playing it
with all of us now.

535
00:24:16,717 --> 00:24:17,885
Okay.

536
00:24:17,968 --> 00:24:21,722
[Ryuya] That was how I kept you
from being able to play with her.

537
00:24:22,556 --> 00:24:24,183
And because of that,

538
00:24:24,266 --> 00:24:29,104
you didn't have time to talk to her
and you moved away, shortly after.

539
00:24:30,439 --> 00:24:31,273
I see.

540
00:24:32,608 --> 00:24:33,775
Well, what a relief.

541
00:24:34,276 --> 00:24:37,196
I thought it was because Anzu
didn't wanna play with me anymore.

542
00:24:37,696 --> 00:24:40,782
Come on, man!
Why the hell aren't you mad at me?

543
00:24:40,866 --> 00:24:43,827
Uh, well, it's, it's all
in the past for me.

544
00:24:43,911 --> 00:24:46,038
And anyway,
I get to hang out with Anzu now.

545
00:24:46,121 --> 00:24:46,955
[sighs]

546
00:24:47,539 --> 00:24:50,334
This whole time, you felt guilty about it.

547
00:24:51,084 --> 00:24:53,212
-[Ryuya] This guy's way too nice.
-[chuckles]

548
00:24:53,295 --> 00:24:56,006
Well, I wanna apologize for that too.

549
00:24:56,590 --> 00:25:00,510
Sorry, but it's not like I've given up
on Anzu, all right?

550
00:25:00,594 --> 00:25:02,679
-Well, I, um--
-[Ryuya] You like her, right?

551
00:25:02,763 --> 00:25:03,639
[gasps]

552
00:25:05,557 --> 00:25:08,185
It's totally obvious, man. Let's go.

553
00:25:11,605 --> 00:25:15,484
[all] Ryuya!
Congratulations on your heartbreak!

554
00:25:15,567 --> 00:25:17,361
[Yamaguchi] All right! Let's do a round

555
00:25:17,444 --> 00:25:19,404
where we dedicate
all the heartbreak songs to Ryuya!

556
00:25:19,488 --> 00:25:20,656
[all cheering]

557
00:25:20,739 --> 00:25:21,573
BREAKUP SONG RANKING

558
00:25:21,657 --> 00:25:23,158
[Ryuya] You guys, what?

559
00:25:23,242 --> 00:25:25,452
This is seriously so messed up!

560
00:25:25,535 --> 00:25:26,370
BREAKUP SONG RANKING

561
00:25:27,412 --> 00:25:28,997
A fanfare, please!

562
00:25:29,081 --> 00:25:31,500
And a big congratulations!

563
00:25:31,583 --> 00:25:33,502
Did you fall for my little trick?

564
00:25:33,585 --> 00:25:36,546
I bet now you don't feel like
skipping the ending, right?

565
00:25:36,630 --> 00:25:40,300
In today's world, you can watch
whatever you want at your own convenience.

566
00:25:40,384 --> 00:25:43,053
But don't you think in that process
we've also lost something?

567
00:25:43,136 --> 00:25:45,639
[sighs]
Don't just let things be! Come on!

568
00:25:45,722 --> 00:25:48,100
Let's go on a super-duper happy adventure!

569
00:25:48,183 --> 00:25:50,102
So I can make sure I get paid.

570
00:25:50,185 --> 00:25:52,354
[closing theme music]

571
00:25:52,437 --> 00:25:53,272
♪ Ah, yeah! ♪

572
00:25:55,816 --> 00:25:56,733
♪ Let's go! ♪

573
00:25:58,819 --> 00:26:00,112
♪ Lo-love! ♪

574
00:26:02,489 --> 00:26:03,323
♪ Here we go! ♪

575
00:26:03,407 --> 00:26:06,618
♪ Sorry that I'm forcing you ♪

576
00:26:06,702 --> 00:26:09,871
♪ But I promise you'll enjoy
A wonderful future ♪

577
00:26:09,955 --> 00:26:16,586
♪ No, no to your three greatest needs
Video games, chocolates, and cats ♪

578
00:26:16,670 --> 00:26:19,506
I'll never give myself up to these ikemen!

579
